---
---

<section class="section principles-section" id="principles">
  <div class="container principles__inner">
    <div class="principles__header">
      <div class="principles__kicker">
        <span class="principles__kicker-sq"></span> OUR PHILOSOPHY
      </div>
      <h2 class="principles__title">Three Ideas Behind Everything We Build</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="principles__divider"></div>

    <div class="principles-grid">
      <article class="principle-item">
        <span class="principle-item__num">01</span>
        <h3 class="principle-item__title">Next</h3>
        <p class="principle-item__desc">
          Building future-ready technology that adapts to changing business needs and emerging opportunities.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="principle-item">
        <span class="principle-item__num">02</span>
        <h3 class="principle-item__title">Network</h3>
        <p class="principle-item__desc">
          Connecting people, processes, and platforms through seamless digital systems.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="principle-item">
        <span class="principle-item__num">03</span>
        <h3 class="principle-item__title">Navigate</h3>
        <p class="principle-item__desc">
          Simplifying complexity through thoughtful engineering, practical innovation, and intuitive experiences.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="principles__header principles__header--sub">
      <div class="principles__kicker">
        <span class="principles__kicker-sq"></span> WHY N3 GLOBAL TECH
      </div>
      <h2 class="principles__title">Engineers who've shipped and kept systems running</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="principles__divider"></div>

    <div class="principles-prose">
      <p>
        Businesses don't need another agency promising transformation. They need engineers who've actually shipped and run the systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        We don't just build software for clients — we run our own SaaS products in production, which means every system we design is shaped by what actually breaks at scale, not what looks good in a pitch deck.
      </p>
      <p>
        Custom platform, SaaS product, or full operations overhaul — we build for what happens after launch, not launch day.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .principles-section {
    padding: 3.75rem 0;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .principles__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
  }

  .principles__header--sub {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .principles__kicker {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #64748b;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .principles__kicker-sq {
    width: 6.5px;
    height: 6.5px;
    background-color: #0284c7;
    display: inline-block;
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  .principles__title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.2vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .principles__divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: #e2e8f0;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .principles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .principle-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }

  .principle-item__num {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #0284c7;
  }

  .principle-item__title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 450;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .principle-item__desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #475569;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .principles-prose {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .principles-prose p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #475569;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .principles-prose p:first-child {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #0f172a;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .principles-section {
      padding: 2.75rem 0;
    }

    .principles-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .principles__header--sub {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .principles__header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .principles__divider {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
